title: The Brocksby Trial
new-page: true
subtitle: A magazine is tried for revealing military secrets...
view-if: year = 1929 and (month = 8 or month = 9) and judicial_reform < 4
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: weltbuhne_seen = 1
face-image: img/weltbune.jpg
tags: event

# if the Marchers controls the judiciary then they can just cancel the trial (at the expense of Golds relations).
# If in a grand coalition then the Marchers can pressure the coalition to cancel the trial at the expense of dissent.
# If the trial goes ahead, then War Loans negotiation process gets set back by a few steps and relations with the west suffers.

= The Brocksby Trial

The <span style="color: #c00000;">left-wing</span> news and literary magazine Brocksby has been targeted by the national authorities for allegedly revealing state secrets. The magazine published articles alleging a secret rearmament program by the Commonwealth Army, in contravention of the Treaty of Etaluxia. The military authorities obviously do not want this information to be known. It does not help that the magazine's editor, Carl Ostwick, is a well-known pacifist.

[? if marcher_in_government and justice_minister_party = "Marcher" : With our control of the Justice Ministry, we could simply drop the case. ?]
[? if marcher_in_government and justice_minister_party != "Marcher" : The Justice Ministry is seeking to persecute the editor and journalist of Brocksby. We can try to persuade our coalition partners to drop the case, but they will likely resist. ?]

- @drop_case: Drop the case.
- @let_persecute: Let justice take its course.
- @pressure_drop: Pressure our coalition partners to drop the case.
- @nothing: There is nothing we can do.

@drop_case
view-if: marcher_in_government
choose-if: marcher_in_government and justice_minister_party = "Marcher"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not marcher_in_government : <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> not in government. ?] [? if marcher_in_government and justice_minister_party != "Marcher": The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> does not control the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: weltbuhne_dropped = 1; gold_relation -= 4; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_grand_coalition or (in_weimar_coalition and lvp_formed)); army_loyalty -= 0.05; west_relation += 1; east_relation += 1; coup_progress += 1; reparations_negotiation += 1; pacifism += 1; ddp_relation += 3; ddp_left += 1; lvp_relation -= 2; dufour_angry += 5

The Justice Ministry has dropped all persecution of Carl Ostwick and Walter Kreiser, the journalist responsible for the offending publication. In fact, some say that the Brocksby journalists should be feted as heroes.

The Western powers and all countries that feel threatened by Commonwealth militarism are pleased that we have turned a chapter in our history.
[? if (in_grand_coalition or (in_weimar_coalition and lvp_formed)): On the other hand, the right-wing members of our governing coalition disapprove of this action, as does the Commonwealth Army. ?][? if not in_grand_coalition : On the other hand, the Commonwealth Army disapproves of dropping the case. ?]

@let_persecute
view-if: marcher_in_government
on-arrival: weltbuhne_dropped = 0; gold_relation += 4; army_loyalty += 0.05; west_relation -= 1; east_relation -= 1; reparations_negotiation -= 1; pacifism -= 1; nationalism += 4; left_dissent += 5; lvp_relation += 2; dufour_angry -= 5

The case progresses slowly, given the military secrets involved, and there will be no determination made for a while. The Commonwealth Army is pleased of our loyalty. However, the affair has made the Western powers suspicious of our resurgent militarism, as well as displeasing the left wing of the party.

@pressure_drop
view-if: marcher_in_government and justice_minister_party != "Marcher"
on-arrival: weltbuhne_dropped = 1; gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 3; nationalism += 3*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_grand_coalition or (in_weimar_coalition and lvp_formed)); army_loyalty -= 0.05; coup_progress += 1; west_relation += 1; east_relation += 1; reparations_negotiation += 1; ddp_left += 1; dufour_angry += 5

We have pressured the Justice Ministry to drop the case against the Brocksby, raising tensions with our coalition.

The Western powers and all countries that feel threatened by Commonwealth militarism are pleased that we have turned a chapter in our history. On the other hand, the Commonwealth Army disapproves of dropping the case.

@nothing
view-if: not marcher_in_government
on-arrival: weltbuhne_dropped = 0; west_relation -= 1; east_relation -= 1; reparations_negotiation -= 1; pacifism -= 1; nationalism += 4

The case progresses slowly, given the military secrets involved, and there will be no determination made for a while. However, the affair has made the Western powers suspicious of our resurgent militarism.